<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Application Update</title>
</head>
<body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333;">
    <div style="max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background-color: #ffffff;">
        <!-- Header -->
        <div style="background-color: #374151; padding: 30px 20px; text-align: center;">
            {{#if companyLogo}}
            <img src="{{companyLogo}}" alt="{{organizationName}}" style="max-height: 50px; margin-bottom: 20px;">
            {{/if}}
            <h1 style="color: #ffffff; margin: 0; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 500;">Application Status Update</h1>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Main Content -->
        <div style="padding: 40px 30px;">
            <h2 style="color: #374151; margin: 0 0 20px; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 500;">
                Dear {{candidateName}},
            </h2>
            
            <p style="margin: 0 0 20px; font-size: 16px; color: #374151;">
                Thank you for your application for the <strong>{{jobTitle}}</strong> position at {{organizationName}}. We sincerely appreciate the time and effort you invested in applying to join our team.
            </p>
            
            <div style="background-color: #f9fafb; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 25px 0; border-left: 4px solid #6b7280;">
                <p style="margin: 0; color: #374151; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6;">
                    After careful review of your application and qualifications, we have decided not to move forward with your candidacy at this time.
                </p>
            </div>
            
            {{#if feedback}}
            <div style="background-color: #fef3c7; border: 1px solid #f59e0b; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 25px 0;">
                <h4 style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: #92400e; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600;">
                    Feedback from our team:
                </h4>
                <p style="margin: 0; color: #92400e; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5;">
                    {{feedback}}
                </p>
            </div>
            {{/if}}
            
            <p style="margin: 25px 0; color: #374151; font-size: 16px;">
                We received many outstanding applications for this position, and while your background and experience are impressive, we've selected candidates whose specific skills and experience more closely match our current requirements.
            </p>
            
            <div style="background-color: #f0f9ff; border: 1px solid #3b82f6; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 25px 0;">
                <h4 style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: #1e40af; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600;">
                    We value your interest in our company
                </h4>
                <p style="margin: 0; color: #1e3a8a; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5;">
                    This decision is specific to this particular role and should not discourage you from applying for future positions with us that might be a better fit for your skills and career goals.
                </p>
            </div>
            
            <div style="background-color: #ecfdf5; border: 1px solid #22c55e; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 25px 0;">
                <h4 style="margin: 0 0 15px; color: #166534; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600;">
                    Future opportunities:
                </h4>
                <ul style="margin: 0; color: #15803d; font-size: 15px; padding-left: 20px;">
                    <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">Keep an eye on our careers page for new openings</li>
                    <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">We'll keep your information on file for suitable future roles</li>
                    <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">Feel free to apply again when you see a position that matches your expertise</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            
            <p style="margin: 25px 0; color: #374151; font-size: 16px;">
                Your qualifications are valuable, and we're confident that you'll find an excellent opportunity that aligns perfectly with your career aspirations.
            </p>
            
            <div style="text-align: center; margin: 30px 0; padding: 15px; background-color: #f8fafc; border-radius: 6px;">
                <p style="margin: 0; color: #64748b; font-size: 15px; font-style: italic;">
                    Thank you for considering {{organizationName}} as a potential employer.<br>
                    We wish you all the best in your job search.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Footer -->
        <div style="background-color: #f9fafb; padding: 30px; text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;">
            <p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: #374151; font-weight: 500; font-size: 16px;">
                Best wishes,
            </p>
            <p style="margin: 0; color: #6b7280; font-size: 15px;">
                {{organizationName}} Hiring Team
            </p>
            
            <div style="margin-top: 25px; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;">
                <p style="margin: 0; color: #9ca3af; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;">
                    This email was sent regarding your application for {{jobTitle}}.<br>
                    Please do not reply directly to this email.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
